# FILES: everything LatteOS puts on a system, so that it can be installed and taken off again.
#
# One line a file:   target <- source     The source is a path in this repository, or
#   build:NAME       the program cargo builds from crates/NAME
#   system:PATH      a file the system already has, copied
#   plugin:NAME      the Hyprland plugin `make` builds in plugins/NAME (needs hyprland-devel; again after every update of Hyprland)
# tests/check.sh fails when a source is missing here or a file meant for the system is not listed.

